    "d6"
   ],
   "spoken": "We don't need to chase the bishop; it isn't doing much. But note the principle of proximity — the closer things happen to your king, the more attentive you must be. If the bishop had pinned a knight near your king, then h6 would be the move.",
   "kind": "plan",
   "teaches": [
