   "line": [
    "Bb6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Don't trade the bishops here — that would open the f-file for HIM. Drop the bishop back to b6 instead, so that if he takes it, YOU get to open the a-file for your rook.",
   "kind": "plan",
   "teaches": [
